{"id":"bb495d7446e8fef8","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-supertruth.md","title":"相对于精确化类的超真集合","display":"df-supertruth — 相对于精确化类的超真集合","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-supertruth","aliases":["91-df-supertruth","91-df-supertruth-predicate"],"display":"df-supertruth — 相对于精确化类的超真集合","depends_on":["[[91-df-supervaluation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-supertruth"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-supertruth</span><span>91-df-supertruth-predicate</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-supertruth — 相对于精确化类的超真集合"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3f012d0f8371bf9a\" href=\"?note=3f012d0f8371bf9a\" title=\"91-df-supervaluation\">91-df-supervaluation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(\\mathcal E\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3f012d0f8371bf9a\" href=\"?note=3f012d0f8371bf9a\" title=\"91-df-supervaluation\">91-df-supervaluation</a> 的经典精确化类，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_{\\mathcal E}^{+},T_{\\mathcal E}^{-}\">\\(T_{\\mathcal E}^{+},T_{\\mathcal E}^{-}\\)</span> 为对应的超真、超假编码集；当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E=\\operatorname{Prec}_{\\mathcal L_T}(v)\">\\(\\mathcal E=\\operatorname{Prec}_{\\mathcal L_T}(v)\\)</span> 时，也记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_v^{+},T_v^{-}\">\\(T_v^{+},T_v^{-}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}supertruth}\\vdash\\quad\nT_{\\mathcal E}^{+}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner:\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T},\\ \\forall w\\in\\mathcal E\\;w(\\varphi)=\\mathbf t\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}supertruth}\\vdash\\quad\nT_{\\mathcal E}^{+}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner:\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T},\\ \\forall w\\in\\mathcal E\\;w(\\varphi)=\\mathbf t\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>两个集合均在元层定义，不是对象理论自动拥有的可定义谓词。非空性给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_{\\mathcal E}^{+}\\cap T_{\\mathcal E}^{-}=\\varnothing\">\\(T_{\\mathcal E}^{+}\\cap T_{\\mathcal E}^{-}=\\varnothing\\)</span>；经典否定给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in T_{\\mathcal E}^{-}\\leftrightarrow\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\in T_{\\mathcal E}^{+}\">\\(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in T_{\\mathcal E}^{-}\\leftrightarrow\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\in T_{\\mathcal E}^{+}\\)</span>。两者可能没有穷尽全部句子编码。\n是否构成某个跳跃算子的固定点要另行证明；超真/超假集合的定义本身不等于极小固定点。</p>\n<p>来源：第 18 章，印刷页 250–251；集合关系由精确化的二值否定语义推出。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-supervaluation","status":"resolved","id":"3f012d0f8371bf9a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-supervaluation]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-supervaluation","status":"resolved","id":"3f012d0f8371bf9a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E\\ne\\varnothing$ 为 [[91-df-supervaluation]] 的经典精确化类，$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal E\\ne\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}","display":false},{"tex":"T_{\\mathcal E}^{+},T_{\\mathcal E}^{-}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E=\\operatorname{Prec}_{\\mathcal L_T}(v)","display":false},{"tex":"T_v^{+},T_v^{-}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}supertruth}\\vdash\\quad\nT_{\\mathcal E}^{+}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner:\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T},\\ \\forall w\\in\\mathcal E\\;w(\\varphi)=\\mathbf t\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"T_{\\mathcal E}^{+}\\cap T_{\\mathcal E}^{-}=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in T_{\\mathcal E}^{-}\\leftrightarrow\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\in T_{\\mathcal E}^{+}","display":false}],"bytes":1451,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-116","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-supertruth]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-89","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-coded-syntax.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-axioms.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conjunction-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-conservative-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conservativity-proof.md]]\n[[91-df-consistency-predicate.md]]\n[[91-df-continuity.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-expressive-completeness.md]]\n[[91-df-external-consistency.md]]\n[[91-df-external-logic.md]]\n[[91-df-external-negation.md]]\n[[91-df-extrinsic-fixed-point.md]]\n[[91-df-fixed-point-model.md]]\n[[91-df-gap-se